# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies (the Cargo workspace, the files embedded at compile
# time — rules/ and tools/extract.py — and the licence files).
# Nothing else from the checkout reaches the builder: local state, databases, agent or editor folders, `.env`, keys.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
!crates/
!rules/
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/extract.py
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

# Never sent, not even from inside the allowed folders.
**/target
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.footnote-backup
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.token
**/.DS_Store
